    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are pleased to offer for sale this substantial detached residence in the popular Moyola Park in the Newcastle area of Galway City.\n\nThe property consists of spacious accommodation with approximately 155.7 sq. m & offers excellent potential throughout.\n\nThe ground floor is arranged between two large adjacent reception rooms, a dining area which leads to the kitchen area that overlooks the private garden and is completed via an adjacent utility space. \n\nUpstairs is arranged via four sizeable bedrooms, all with fitted storage & one availing of its own W.C., and a main family bathroom.\n\nFurthermore, 48 Moyola Park benefits from a self-contained unit with its own private side entrance and consists of a kitchenette, W.C, shower room & its own bedroom. This space could easily be re-integrated into the home or be utilised as a quality investment opportunity.\n\nA key feature of no. 48 Moyola Park is the outside space on offer. The front of the property currently offers off-street parking for two vehicles, along with a manicured lawn & hedge frontage, as well as overlooking one of the communal greens.\n\nThe private rear garden is an impressive area with an abundance of space & encompassed by mature greenery.\n\nMoyola Park is a long established & popular residential area of Newcastle, Galway City. The residential estate offers plentiful communal green space & is within walking distance of Galway University, UCHG, Dangan Sportsgrounds & Galway City Centre.\n\nAdditionally, all amenities & services are within easy reach as expected from the locale. The area is a popular family location given the proximity to quality local schools.\n\nNo. 48 Moyola Park is an impressive property offering huge potential.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie Keep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database.For Further details please contact O'Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212 \n\nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PMNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.FLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only. The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout. All enquiries must be directed to the agent.Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.No person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
